Dispatch trim after patch 28. JALR calls PS2Runtime::callGuestFunction too (kind IndirectCall, "JALR"; a target outside
the table, misaligned or missing still takes dispatchGuestBranch, PS2X_STATIC_CALLS=dispatch emits the old call).
dispatchGuestBranch reaches the PS2X_GS_WORKER_TRACE statics only when g_ps2FullCallDispatch is set. The empty
ps2TraceGuestWrite hook (upstream TODO: delete) is gone from the write macros, Store8..128 and the recompiler's
constant-address writes. Tests: callGuestFunction parity now covers IndirectCall; JALR codegen expectations.

